{"suttaId":"sn22.149","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[854,858],"vripara":"149"},"segments":{"sn22.149:0.3":"Anattānupassīsuttaṃ","sn22.149:1.1":"Sāvatthinidānaṃ.","sn22.149:1.2":"“Saddhāpabbajitassa, bhikkhave, kulaputtassa ayamanudhammo hoti –","sn22.149:1.3":"yaṃ rūpe anattānupassī vihareyya.","sn22.149:1.4":"Vedanāya …","sn22.149:1.5":"saññāya …","sn22.149:1.6":"saṅkhāresu …","sn22.149:1.7":"viññāṇe anattānupassī vihareyya.(So rūpe) anattānupassī viharanto, vedanāya …","sn22.149:1.9":"saññāya …","sn22.149:1.10":"saṅkhāresu …","sn22.149:1.11":"viññāṇe anattānupassī viharanto rūpaṃ parijānāti, vedanaṃ … pe …","sn22.149:1.12":"saññaṃ …","sn22.149:1.13":"saṅkhāre …","sn22.149:1.14":"viññāṇaṃ parijānāti.","sn22.149:1.15":"So rūpaṃ parijānaṃ vedanaṃ parijānaṃ saññaṃ parijānaṃ saṅkhāre parijānaṃ viññāṇaṃ parijānaṃ parimuccati rūpamhā, parimuccati vedanāya, parimuccati saññāya, parimuccati saṅkhārehi, parimuccati viññāṇamhā, parimuccati jātiyā jarāya maraṇena sokehi paridevehi dukkhehi domanassehi upāyāsehi;","sn22.149:1.16":"‘parimuccati dukkhasmā’ti vadāmī”ti.","sn22.149:1.17":"Cuddasamaṃ.","sn22.149:1.18":"Kukkuḷavaggo cuddasamo.","sn22.149:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn22.149:2.1":"Kukkuḷā tayo aniccena,","sn22.149:2.2":"dukkhena apare tayo;","sn22.149:2.3":"Anattena tayo vuttā,","sn22.149:2.4":"kulaputtena dve dukāti."},"unsure":["sn22.149:1.7"],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":391,"to":394,"paras":[{"para":391,"vripara":"136-149","refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["136-149. Kukkuḷavaggassa paṭhame <b>kukkuḷan</b>ti santattaṃ ādittaṃ chārikarāsiṃ viya mahāpariḷāhaṃ.","Imasmiṃ sutte dukkhalakkhaṇaṃ kathitaṃ, sesesu aniccalakkhaṇādīni.","Sabbāni cetāni pāṭiyekkaṃ puggalajjhāsayena kathitānīti."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"],["sn22.149:1"],["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo cuddasamo."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["Diṭṭhivaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":394,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["1-9. Ajjhattasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":395,"to":399,"paras":[{"para":395,"vripara":"136-149","refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["136-149. Anto aggi mahanto chārikarāsi, tattha ukkuḷavikulato akkamantaṃ yāva kesaggaṃ anudahatāya kucchitaṃ kuḷanti kukkuḷaṃ, rūpavedanādi pana tatopi kañci kālaṃ anudahanato mahāpariḷāhanaṭṭhena ca kukkuḷaṃ viyāti <b>kukkuḷaṃ.</b>","<b>Aniccalakkhaṇādīnī</b>ti aniccadukkhānattalakkhaṇāni."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"],["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":396,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":397,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":398,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["Diṭṭhivaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]},{"para":399,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.149:1"],"lines":["1-9. Ajjhattasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.149:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
